load @term/seed/code/structure/set
  find set

# An operation: a function that combines elements of a set into another element of the same set, the verb of an
# algebraic structure, unary (one argument, like negation) or binary (two, like addition). The arity and the laws it
# obeys are what distinguish one structure from another. The form carries the set the operation acts on.
form operation
  link set, like set
